1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:01,870
(Sheldon:)Would you like to hear
another reason

2
00:00:01,936 --> 00:00:03,806
(Sheldon:)why men are
better than women?

3
00:00:03,870 --> 00:00:08,110
(Leonard:)Sure, let's make it
an even hundred.

4
00:00:08,174 --> 00:00:10,774
(Sheldon:)You would never kiss me
and make me say "I love you"

5
00:00:10,844 --> 00:00:12,444
(Sheldon:)and then break up with me.

6
00:00:12,512 --> 00:00:15,382
(Penny:)I wouldn't.

7
00:00:15,449 --> 00:00:17,849
(Sheldon:)And you know why?

8
00:00:17,918 --> 00:00:19,388
'Cause you're a man.

9
00:00:19,453 --> 00:00:22,893
(Sheldon:)The champagne of genders.

10
00:00:22,956 --> 00:00:25,056
(Leonard:)Well, I may be a man,

11
00:00:25,124 --> 00:00:27,964
(Leonard:)but I think I'm the one
that screwed up on this one.

12
00:00:28,027 --> 00:00:31,597
(Sheldon:)Yeah, well, and you admit it,
like a man.

13
00:00:31,664 --> 00:00:33,064
(Sheldon:)All you hear
women say is,

14
00:00:33,131 --> 00:00:35,731
"I'll just have a salad."
You know?

15
00:00:35,801 --> 00:00:37,531
"Where's my lip gloss?"

16
00:00:37,603 --> 00:00:40,273
"I think this element
should be called radium."

17
00:00:42,074 --> 00:00:44,714
(Sheldon:)That last one was Madame Curie.

18
00:00:44,777 --> 00:00:47,407
(Leonard:)I figured that out.

19
00:00:47,479 --> 00:00:49,849
(Leonard:)You know what?
She was kind of an honorary man.

20
00:00:49,914 --> 00:00:53,284
(Sheldon:)She had a penis made of science.

21
00:00:56,654 --> 00:01:00,194
(Leonard:)Can't believe I'm spending
my wedding night with you.

22
00:01:00,258 --> 00:01:01,588
(Raj:)Really?

23
00:01:01,659 --> 00:01:03,829
(Sheldon:)I never imagined it
any other way.

